Description: Quantitative ecology tools and R companion for VPro (VENUS --
    Vegetation and Environment NexUS -- Professional) and the British Columbia
    Ministry of Forests Biogeoclimatic Ecosystem Classification (BEC) program.
    Supports safe read access alongside VPro Desktop project files, tidy
    vegetation and LMH25 (2023) soil extraction, BCPlantTaxonomy v19 and BECdb
    v13 standards harmonization, community matrices, multivariate clustering,
    GeoPackage export, field data quality validation, climr climate normals and
    Ministry actual soil moisture regime (aSMR) modelling, dual edatopic grids,
    BEC diagnostic synthesis, safeguarded site-unit and lumping write-back,
    provincial BECMaster cloud queries, contributor staging, custodian
    three-way merges, portable RDS snapshots, and Quarto BEC field guides.
